"""Built-in OpenSubtitles.com API key (optional).

Subtitles from OpenSubtitles work out of the box when a key is available
here or in the DOPEIPTV_OPENSUBTITLES_KEY environment variable. To ship one:

  1. Copy this file to  dopeiptv/_opensubtitles_key.py  (git-ignored), or
  2. export DOPEIPTV_OPENSUBTITLES_KEY=<your key>  before running, or
  3. for release builds, set a DOPEIPTV_OPENSUBTITLES_KEY GitHub Actions
     secret so it is baked into the packaged artifacts without ever
     touching git.

The key is an "API consumer" key: sign in at opensubtitles.com, open
https://www.opensubtitles.com/consumers and create one for the app. A key
a user enters in Settings always overrides this.

The real key is deliberately never committed to the public repository.
"""

OPENSUBTITLES_API_KEY = ""
